title: Reshuffle the Cabinet
new-page: true
is-card: true
card-image: img/cards/cabinet.jpg
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
view-if: con_in_government = 1 and reshuffle_timer <= 0 and months_in_office >= 6
on-arrival: reshuffle_timer = 12; month_actions += 1
call: cabinet_recalc

= Reshuffle the Cabinet

The Cabinet is [+ cabinet_dry +]% dry. Chancellor: [+ chancellor +] ([+ chancellor_dry : drywet +]). Employment: [+ employment_secretary +] ([+ employment_dry : drywet +]). Industry: [+ industry_secretary +] ([+ industry_dry : drywet +]). Home Office: [+ home_secretary +]. Foreign Office: [+ foreign_secretary +]. Environment: [+ environment_secretary +]. Defence: [+ defence_secretary +]. Education: [+ education_secretary +]. Health and Social Security: [+ health_secretary +].

[? if cabinet_revolt >= 5 : The wets in Cabinet are close to open revolt. ?]

- @ministers.purge_start
- @ministers: Move ministers between departments.
- @bring_back: Bring the wets back into the economic departments.
- @loyalists: Promote loyal managers.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@bring_back
view-if: employment_dry = 1 or industry_dry = 1
subtitle: Jim Prior back to Employment, Peter Walker to Industry. Calms the wets, at the cost of the radical programme.
on-arrival: wets_purged = 0; employment_secretary = "Prior"; employment_dry = 0; industry_secretary = "Walker"; industry_dry = 0; wet_dissent -= 12; dry_dissent += 10; cabinet_revolt -= 3; rebellion -= 2
call: cabinet_recalc

The economic departments go back to the consensus men. The Cabinet is now [+ cabinet_dry +]% dry.

@loyalists
on-arrival: loyalist_dissent -= 6; cabinet_revolt -= 2; rebellion -= 1

Party managers and safe pairs of hands fill the middle-ranking jobs. Nobody is thrilled, and nobody is furious.
